		{"excall", call=0, file="hat040030"},
		line=877,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"These lands still remember the many separate realms that long vied for hegemony since time immemorial.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The mightiest among them was know",
{"ruby", text="the Outland Realm"},
"n as Ko no Kuni. ",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Its soldiers wielded a viciousness known not to any man or beast.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Possessed of no fear, the legions of Ko no Kuni would charge blindly forward, no matter the battlefield, to claim the souls of their enemies─",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Leaving mountains of corpses and rivers of blood in their wake.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Ko no Kuni treated the vanquished peoples of their conquered lands as slaves, pressing them into hard labor until only death granted them final emancipation.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"No realm alone was capable of standing against the tide as Ko no Kuni extended its dominion across the land with the force of a crashing billow.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Thus and so, the peripheral realms joined together in a grand confederation.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The leader of this confederacy was the ruler",
{"ruby", text="the Rising Sun Realm"},
"of Hi no Kuni, Him",
{"/ruby"},
"i-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto was renowned throughout the land for her peerless beauty and her proficiency with magicks.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The chieftains of each realm, who would later become the heads of the thirty-six noble houses, desperately looked to her magicks for their salvation.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Yet Hi no Kuni's confederacy only suffered defeat after defeat.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"The motley armies they fielded stood no chance in the face of Ko no Kuni's mighty legions.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"In short order, the fate of the confederation seemed as a flickering torch before a tempest.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Her back against the wall, Himi-no-Mikoto made a fateful decision.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"She summoned priestesses from all across the land to forge a dread weapon capable of bringing cataclysm upon Ko no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Over a thousand priestesses answered the call.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"A pentacle spanning an entire plain was drawn for the ritual, and all creation was overawed into silence by the majesty of the invocations that flowed forth from its boundaries.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"One after another, the assembled priestesses exhausted their life force and fell where they stood.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Twenty days after the commencement of the ritual─",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Once eight hundred and eighty-eight souls were returned to Oomikami, the legendary Mitsurugi was born.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Alone he stood against the vast legions of Ko no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Each step he advanced left a mountain of corpses in his wake. Each swing of his blade shook the firmament with a mighty tempest.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"As a tool forged from magicks, his was an existence unknown to death.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"No matter how many times he was cut down, he arose and faced the enemy once more.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"And as the armies of Ko no Kuni knew no retreat, Mitsurugi cut them down to the last.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Gazing upon the dreadful vista wrought by his own hand, Mitsurugi did not so much as twitch an eyebrow.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Even mired in flesh and blood up to his ankles, all he did was to dispassionately wipe the sanguinary grime from his blade.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"And so, the great and terrible war ended with Ko no Kuni's vanquishment.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"All the chieftains of the separate realms promptly humbled themselves before Himi-no-Mikoto's leadership and\nMitsurugi's valor.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"The triumphant confederation was formed into a new, united realm with Himi-no-Mikoto as its sovereign.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Such was the origin of Toyoashihara no Mizugaki no Uchi no Sumeramikoto no Kuni─ the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"I accompany Himi-no-Mikoto to her chambers and kneel before the entrance.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"As much as she normally abides mine malapert conduct, she strictly forbids me from overstepping the threshold to her chambers.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Your service is well-rendered. Be off now to your own devices.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ah, that's right. I had intended to ask...”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto turns her head as she pauses before the entrance to her chambers.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Who delivered you that wound upon your back?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"I had already changed garments, so the wound should not be visible.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"But as mine own creator, she would indeed know.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“A mere flesh wound will close in due time.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I'm well aware.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What I wish to know is who dares to injure my Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“It was the man Tooru and I apprehended earlier.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That lowly wretch...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“For him to despoil another's property... How despicable.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"A surly expression crosses Himi-no-Mikoto's face.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Do not think yourself blameless either! Some nerve you have to be wounded by a common criminal.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Do you mean to besmirch the repute of your creator?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Though a simple flesh wound is hardly a matter to this body of mine, Himi-no-Mikoto never fails to revile me whenever she sees me injured.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Tooru tells me it's an expression of her affection.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“I-I humbly beg your pardon!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"A young damsel suddenly leaps out from the shadow of a nearby pillar.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I find myself in ill humor. You'll have no pardon from me.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Huuuh!? Umm... Ooh...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"The girl fidgets about in a panic as she prostrates herself.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Her face seems somehow familiar...",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Might you be the priestess who was assaulted by that criminal?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Y-Yes! Indeed I am.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"The girl flattens herself even lower to the floor.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Oh, an acquaintance of yours?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Please excuse my impudent intrusion.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“My name is Shiinoha Chihaya.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I am well aware that it is the height of insolence to appear before you in such an impetuous manner, yet─”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Enough. State your business.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I simply must clarify, Mitsurugi-sama only suffered his injury because he deigned to protect me!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Is that so, Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“It is as she says.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I wished to express my gratitude forthwith, but I lost sight of Mitsurugi-sama in the ensuing commotion.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Hence I surreptitiously stole into the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Stole into?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ah! Er... Hence I lawfully waited upon the Imperial Palace!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"The girl repeatedly knocks her forehead to the floor.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"The motion sends stray cobwebs and leaves tumbling out of her hair, attesting to her furtive labors.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Oomikami must have surely smiled upon you for you to arrive here unscathed.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“To think that a priestess of Shiinoha would engage in such chicanery...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto crosses her arms with an amused grin.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"She ordinarily has no patience for malefactors, so this is a rare sight indeed.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“...You know of our humble house?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I know well that House Shiinoha faithfully served Oomikami for many years before I came to reign over Hi no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“And the realm will long remember the sacrifices put forth by your house during the calamity that recently befell us.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Your words honor us greatly!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Did you hear that?! Oh, Father! Mother! My hallowed ancestors!”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"The girl's eyes pool over with tears as she quivers with joy.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Chihaya, was it?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If you wish to offer Mitsurugi your gratitude, there is a labor you may perform.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Yes, I am humbly at your service!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The wound on his back has yet to fully recover. Let us see you remedy this with your magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I trust you to do so with unerring proficiency. Leave not a single blemish.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“A-Absolutely! It would be a great honor!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Haah...! Haah... M-Might this be satisfactory, Mitsurugi-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Chihaya's ministrations have completely closed the wound I received.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Not only that─mine body brims with a renewed vitality.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I see you truly are a priestess worthy of the name Shiinoha. Your talents are beyond reproach.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Having observed from beginning to end, Himi-no-Mikoto offers Chihaya a nod of satisfaction.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Such magnificent praise scarcely befits the likes of me.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It requires a considerable amount of spellforce to properly furbish Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“This is quite impressive for your first time.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“You are far too kind!”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“...H-Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Chihaya suddenly sways unsteadily on her feet.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"I rush to catch her right as she falls over.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ahh...? Aaaaaaawhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Are you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ye─I mea─no─umm... Awawaaahhhh...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Her eyes spin dizzyingly around in their sockets.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Do you mean to do her in? Unhand her at once, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Was mine conduct somehow offensive?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Though unable to comprehend, I withdraw mine hands away from Chihaya.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“U-Um, you have most certainly not done anything to cause affront, sire!”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Er, I hesitate to confess this, but the shock of the excitement may have momentarily caused me to swoon...”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The girl has the cheek to fancy you.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Fancy me?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I say!”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Say ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"what",
{"/font"},
" exactly? Do go on...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Chihaya immediately bites her tongue.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I say... was that a butterfly I spotted just now? Ahaha...”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hahaha! Pay it no mind.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Well then, Mitsurugi, what say you to accepting Chihaya as your handmaiden?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I have more important matters to attend to than closing your every injury.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But I would have no objections with entrusting your treatment to her.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Wh-Wh-Why perish the thought, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Chihaya frantically waves her hands in front of her chest.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Hmm...”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I take another good look at her.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“C-Could fulfilling a purpose of such monumental importance truly be a fitting role for the likes of me?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I believe I already said so, did I not?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I-Indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“So long as Chihaya is willing, I mind it not.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Her brilliant smile is as lovely as a flower spreading its petals.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“...Mmgh.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If that is all, I shall retire for the day. Do enjoy each other's company as it pleases you.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto turns without another word and stalks off to her chambers.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Her ill humor seems to have somehow returned.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, Mitsurugi-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Oh, how beside myself I am! To think that Himi-no-Mikoto-sama would bestow upon me a duty of such import!”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Why, to be granted such an honor so soon upon being ordained! How truly blessed I am!”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Chihaya allows her high spirits to overflow as soon as Himi-no-Mikoto withdraws.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“A novice the likes of me is hardly fit to serve one such as you, and I am sure to err on more than a few occasions, but if you would have me!”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Of course. It's mine pleasure.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"After acquainting ourselves with each other, we exit the palace and arrive on the high street of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, wherever might you be headed?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“The Capital Watch guardhouse.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Anyway, just how far do you intend to follow me?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Chihaya told me that she serves as a priestess in the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Yet she continues to follow me further and further away from the temple.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I am merely fulfilling my humble duty as your handmaiden, as per Himi-no-Mikoto's decree.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I shall follow you to the ends of the earth! Juuust like this!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"She leans forward to take mine arm in her own.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"I have no particular objections, but might this arrangement not impede her own lifestyle?",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Oh, a woman on your arm? Taken an interest in the floating world, have we?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Before we even arrive, Tooru pokes his head out of the guardhouse as though he were awaiting me.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“If you have more pleasurable business to attend to, we can always do this another day.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Not at all.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“My name is Shiinoha Chihaya. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Oh, a priestess of the Shiinohas? I know well of your\nhouse's renown, but I have never had the pleasure of making the acquaintance of your kin.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Oh, no, no, I am not one of any account whatsoever. The reputation of my ancestors most certainly precedes me!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Well, aren't you a modest one!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Tooru grins at the flustered Chihaya.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Might I have your own name, sire?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Name's Inou Tooru. Nice to meetcha.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“...Huh? ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"That",
{"/font"},
" Inou Tooru-sama? Might that not make you the head of House Inou?!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Oh dearie me, seems like the reputation of ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"my",
{"/font"},
" ancestors is preceding me as well!”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Am I being jibed at?!”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You do your ancestors a disservice by raising their name in jest.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I know, I know.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"After exchanging a few pleasantries, Chihaya tells Tooru how she was entrusted with the duty of furbishing this body of mine.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I'll say, that's some Imperial appointment.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Truly so. I can still hardly believe it myself.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Tooru starts making way as we converse with each other.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi and I were planning to indulge ourselves in some drink. Care to tag along?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Why, I would not dream of declining such an invitation!”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Oho? Could it be that you can hold your liquor?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I have partaken of the offering wine ever since I was a child! I am most confident in my ability to handle my drink.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Now that's what I like to hear, Chihaya-dono! I like you already!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“The two of us are gonna get along juuust fine!”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Huzzah! It is my pleasure!”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Good for us, eh, Mitsurugi? We've found ourselves another buddy to get soused with.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Guess so.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Tooru is a much heavier drinker than I, but I do not mind it myself, especially if it means the three of us can enjoy our time together.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Tooru is paying today. Chihaya, feel free to drink as much as you'd like.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Is that truly so?!”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Good grief... I sure hope I packed enough coins in my purse...”",
			},
